## Skills Demonstrated

- **API integration** — calling a third-party REST API, handling authentication, and parsing a nested JSON response
- **Data enrichment** — combining data from multiple upstream sources (form + API) into a single unified record
- **Conditional logic** — filtering records based on both string and date comparisons
- **Scheduled automation** — a fully independent, timer-driven workflow separate from the event-driven intake pipeline
- **Debugging real-world data shapes** — handling Baserow's single-select field objects, date formatting requirements, and cross-node data referencing
- **CRM design** — structuring a data table to support both automated writes and manual status tracking

## Outcome

New contacts are automatically validated, enriched, and logged with zero manual data entry, and stale leads get surfaced automatically instead of relying on memory. The system runs continuously in the background and required debugging real API errors, nested data structures, and field-type mismatches — the same kinds of issues that come up in production automation work.

## Next Steps

Planned extensions: AI-generated contact summaries/follow-up drafts, and a second automation pulling relevant listings from a job-board RSS feed into the same system.
